.MARINE...
(Today through Saturday)
Issued at 920 AM PDT Mon Oct 26 2026

North to northwesterly gentle breezes become moderate to fresh
this  afternoon through the majority of the week. Strong gusts
develop  this afternoon across the southern coastal waters near
Point Sur and  Monterey Bay. These strong gusts gradually spread
across the  northern coastal waters near Point Reyes by Tuesday.
Isolated near  gale force gusts are likely within the coastal jet
regions of Point  Sur and Point Reyes. In response, moderate seas
briefly build to  rough around 8 to 10 ft across the outer waters
Tuesday afternoon  into Wednesday. Moderate wind driven seas
prevail Thursday into the  weekend.

